1
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,760
You have been by my side

2
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,920
since the first day
you entered the mansion.

3
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,120
In this vast mansion,

4
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:59,160
you are the only one
who treats me with sincerity.

5
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:00,920
I do not believe
you would intentionally harm me.

6
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:01,440
Oh no.

7
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,200
It is time to brew medicine for My Lady.

8
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:03,840
I must go and see

9
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:05,160
if the medicine is ready.

10
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,690
My Lady, please wait for me!

11
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,520
My Lady, why are you alone again?

12
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:09,920
Sitting here in the wind?

13
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:10,800
Your legs

14
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:12,480
can't take any more cold.

15
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,220
My Lady,

16
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,120
I went to the courtyard

17
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,720
and picked your favorite flowers.

18
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:16,440
Smell them.

19
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,760
They are so fragrant.

20
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:30,520
Your wedding is approaching,

21
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:32,850
yet you are mourning
the dead in your room.

22
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:34,020
Preposterous!

23
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,960
Lan and I were as close as sisters.

24
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,720
I must see her off.

25
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,600
Yet you, Father,

26
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:42,740
took a life with your own hands

27
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,640
and still feel so at ease.

28
00:01:47,039 --> 00:01:48,840
Your wedding with Ning Yuanci

29
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,530
will proceed as scheduled.

30
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:53,100
I have already locked Ying'er up.

31
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,759
I advise you to drop the idea

32
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:56,320
of breaking the engagement,

33
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:59,050
let alone having your sister
marry in your place.

34
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:01,400
In your dreams.

35
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,260
I'd rather die than marry him.

36
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:09,440
Are you willing to send your sister

37
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,919
to her death?

38
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,880
My stomach suddenly hurts so much.

39
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:33,520
Somebody, help!

40
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:36,000
Help!

41
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:37,800
Second Miss,

42
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,880
you've been making a fuss all night.

43
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:40,940
The Master ordered

44
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,520
that we cannot let you out

45
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,980
under any circumstances.

46
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:48,320
Is there a bug in this script?

47
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,760
If I'm trapped here,

48
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:52,020
how am I supposed to save the female lead?

49
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,520
Actor Xia Yimo.

50
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,320
Xu Yu.

51
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,880
You finally showed up.

52
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:03,240
By the way,

53
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,320
do you have any key clues

54
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,960
or items

55
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,300
that can lead straight to the ending?

56
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:10,880
I am not a game system.

57
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:14,160
Please do not make unreasonable requests.

58
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:17,360
Then why are you here?

59
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,360
General, please wait.

60
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:21,560
The Duke is not receiving guests today.

61
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:23,130
General.

62
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,360
General, what is the meaning
of surrounding my residence

63
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,600
with your men?

64
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:32,360
I have heard that Your Grace

65
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,600
caught the culprit who poisoned

66
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:34,680
Xue Ruowan.

67
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,880
It was a thief within the household.

68
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,360
I have already dealt with her
according to family law.

69
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,600
The poison used on Xue Ruowan

70
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,760
is a poisonous herb
from the Northern Frontier.

71
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:43,040
How did a household thief

72
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:43,960
obtain it?

73
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:44,960
And

74
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:47,520
is there a mastermind behind her?

75
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,000
Your Grace executed her on the spot

76
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,400
without asking anything clearly?

77
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:56,040
Your father and I were brothers.

78
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,360
I was also deeply grieved

79
00:03:58,720 --> 00:04:00,520
when he died in battle five years ago.

80
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,400
I know you have never been able

81
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,600
to let this matter go.

82
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,720
But could you not

83
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,320
assume every little disturbance

84
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,520
is related to Northern spies?

85
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,320
You and Wan'er

86
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,840
are about to get married.

87
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:12,400
I hope you will prioritize this matter.

88
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,800
Your Grace must not know yet.

89
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,329
The one marrying you now

90
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,760
is Xue Keying.

91
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,730
Where is Xue Keying?

92
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:23,080
Ying'er is not in the residence.

93
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,540
She went to visit relatives
with her mother.

94
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:27,800
Xue Keying!

95
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:29,560
Xue Keying is merely

96
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,960
a concubine's daughter.

97
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,960
Her delusion of taking my place to marry

98
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:35,159
and seizing the position
of the General's wife

99
00:04:35,159 --> 00:04:36,420
is simply a pipe dream.

100
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,760
As the eldest legitimate daughter

101
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,960
of the Duke's estate,

102
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,960
my marriage into the General's manor

103
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,760
is the only proper arrangement.

104
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,170
I advise the General

105
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,800
not to disrupt propriety

106
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,240
for selfish desires.

107
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,530
What do you mean?

108
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,720
That's not what you said before.

109
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,440
There is no affection between us at all.

110
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,240
And now

111
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,370
you want to marry me?

112
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,360
This marriage

113
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,880
was your scheme to begin with, General.

114
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,320
You were the one who forced this upon us.

115
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,280
Now that my father and I

116
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,840
have complied with your wishes,

117
00:05:05,840 --> 00:05:08,640
you start talking to me about affection?

118
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:12,000
What His Majesty granted you

119
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,080
was a marriage with the eldest daughter.

120
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:17,010
I advise the General
not to defy the imperial decree.

121
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:20,000
Where exactly is Xue Keying?

122
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,120
I am the one you are engaged to.

123
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,680
Don't get it wrong, General.

124
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,050
You despicable wretch!

125
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:33,400
The marriage contract
was mine to begin with.

126
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:35,000
You try to steal what's mine,

127
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,640
and still act so arrogantly.

128
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:39,340
Who gave you the nerve?

129
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,360
If you want to marry so badly,

130
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,720
then do it.

131
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,440
Consider it my charity.

132
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,920
Do you have any idea what you're saying?

133
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,360
Come here!

134
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,780
What are you doing?

135
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:10,720
You're hurting me.

136
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,840
Are you mad at me

137
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,200
because I failed to persuade His Majesty

138
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:16,260
to change the marriage arrangement?

139
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,640
You were supposed to marry

140
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,920
Xue Ruowan in the first place.

141
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,240
I don't want to fight with her anymore.

142
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:20,840
I'm tired.

143
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,530
Did you ever have

144
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,160
any real feelings for me?

145
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:33,840
I, Xue Keying,

146
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,960
have never liked you.

147
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:37,640
All I ever wanted

148
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:38,680
was the wealth and glory

149
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,010
of the General's Manor.

150
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:42,120
You were fooled by my acting.

151
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,680
That affection,

152
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:44,920
deep love,

153
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:47,100
and fondness can all be faked.

154
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,320
Honestly.

155
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,560
Is it Chu Qingjun?

156
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,050
Have you fallen for him?

157
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,800
Why do you men always assume

158
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,800
that if we don't like you,

159
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:06,640
we must have fallen for someone else?

160
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:07,200
Can't I just

161
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:08,200
not like anyone?

162
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,890
Chu Qingjun is indeed quite nice, though.

163
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,200
Handsome,

164
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,460
considerate, and gentle.

165
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,120
He'd make a fine choice

166
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,360
for a male concubine.

167
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,980
I don't believe it.

168
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,960
Look me in the eyes

169
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,170
and say it again.

170
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,680
Do you think

171
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,130
you are the hero of a storybook?

172
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,960
That everyone must revolve around you

173
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,400
and keep you happy?

174
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,400
You want to control

175
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,280
the Duke's estate

176
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,280
to climb to power.

177
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,060
Now you have your wish.

178
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:56,960
Fine.

179
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:01,410
In that case,

180
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,960
I shall marry both you

181
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:05,900
and Xue Ruowan.

182
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,920
She will be the primary wife,

183
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,680
and you will be the concubine.

184
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,080
I actually don't mind

185
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:18,680
sharing a man with my sister.

186
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:23,200
She gets Mondays, Wednesdays,
and Fridays...

187
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:25,920
I'll take Tuesdays,
Thursdays, and Saturdays.

188
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:26,440
But

189
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:29,200
if you want me to be a concubine,

190
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:29,960
you must give me

191
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:31,240
enough gold and silver jewelry

192
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,320
as compensation.

193
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:38,200
I can still pretend

194
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,080
to be deeply in love with you.

195
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,400
I was wrong about you.

196
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:57,040
You truly belong on the stage
in the theater.

197
00:08:58,800 --> 00:08:59,840
From now on,

198
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:02,160
I never want to see you again.

199
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,520
Then why are you here?

200
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,620
I'm here to tell you

201
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,620
the cruel truth of this world.

202
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:17,640
When you played

203
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:18,770
Xue Keying earlier,

204
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:19,680
because you deviated from

205
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,160
the character's original setting,

206
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,600
the actions of the female lead Xue Ruowan

207
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,120
and the second male lead Ning Yuanci

208
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,320
both changed.

209
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,400
Once the plot of Ning Yuanci

210
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:29,280
forcing Xue Ruowan to marry him
in Mo Xiang's script

211
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,200
is altered,

212
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,440
Xue Ruowan will face

213
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,640
a death crisis again.

214
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:35,840
Are you kidding me?

215
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,640
How can I save the female lead

216
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,640
if I don't change the plot?

217
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:41,960
Only I can modify

218
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,760
the plot and character settings.

219
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:44,760
I know better than you

220
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,160
what the audience likes.

221
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:48,160
You just need to play Xue Keying

222
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,500
as she originally was,

223
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,700
and do what she was supposed to do.

224
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,600
Xue Keying

225
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,480
as she originally was...

226
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:57,760
Remember,

227
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,560
once the plot mission
of playing Xue Keying

228
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,760
fails,

229
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,280
you will only have one last chance

230
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,440
to be reborn.

231
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,600
If you fail all five times,

232
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,480
you will be stuck

233
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:08,080
in the script world forever.

234
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,160
Please get the plot

235
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,220
back on track as soon as possible.

236
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:17,720
My Lady,

237
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,400
I brought you the wedding dress.

238
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,760
Master asked you to try it on.

239
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:21,360
Xiaolan,

240
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:23,460
is that really you?

241
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,200
This servant is not Xiaolan.

242
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,160
You may leave.

243
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,400
This wedding dress is so beautiful.

244
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:48,760
It suits you perfectly, sister.

245
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,800
Thinking that once you are married off,

246
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:55,920
there will be no one left
to bully in the manor,

247
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:59,160
life will be so incredibly boring.

248
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,000
I actually

249
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,880
feel a bit sad.

250
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,480
You will be the General's wife

251
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,610
from now on, Sister.

252
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,880
But once you enter the General's manor,

253
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,160
no one from your maiden home

254
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,640
will back you up.

255
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,840
As for General Ning,

256
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,760
he might

257
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,080
come to my arms every now and then

258
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,320
for some tenderness.

259
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,840
Please don't mind it,

260
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,960
Sister.

261
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,240
Of course I won't.

262
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,960
Then please

263
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,840
keep your eyes wide open and watch.

264
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,920
How I became

265
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:42,160
the General's wife,

266
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,720
the envy of the whole city.
